{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261028/photo/bkn-20261028080002674-1028_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261028113737\"/><p>救護車撞毀一段鐵欄。</p><p>元朗發生交通意外。今晨(28日)7時03分，一輛救護車沿朗日路往博愛醫院方向行駛，至近元朗站時疑失控撞毀路邊鐵欄，車上3名救護員輕傷清醒，其後由另一輛救護車送院治理，意外原因有待調查。據了解，事發時，涉事救護車正前往進行救護任務，車上並無傷者或病人。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T03:42:10.968891+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T00:00:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T07:58:15.197513+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T03:38:41.478751+00:00","content_hash":"56e699db477871da023c9ec35120bf77b9150971baf795f2f3c582b13804d389","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T03:42:10.968891+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}